CRAY LGDB BUILDME

Package version is specified in the definitions.mk file, via the PACKAGE_BRANCH variable

To build RPM run the following command:
  make rpm

If this is a final release:
  make rpm FINAL=1

To generate the install manifest:
  make manifest

To deploy rpm to pkgs dir on css:
  make deploy_rpm

To have rpm and install manifest placed in the dropoff dir on css:
  make install_rpm

